DTEND:20260914T111609Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 13:45:24 and reappears at 14:43:27 +0330\, 
 seen from Tabriz\, IR.\nThe Moon is 33° up in the SSE · daylight\, Sun +
 50°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view
  at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=38.0800
 &lon=46.2919
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=38.0800&lon=46.2919
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
